      "data": {
        "text": "**Initiating Embeddings Creation**\n\nI'm now focused on the initial Python file, `embed_text.py`, for the embeddings API task. My priority is to integrate Google's embeddings API, specifically employing the `gemini-pro` model. This is the starting point for developing the broader set of files.\n\n\n**Outlining Module Structure**\n\nI've established the initial structure for the ten Python files. I will begin with `embed_text.py` and `embed_batch.py`, both utilizing the Google Generative AI library. I will implement a rudimentary `similarity_score.py` using numpy for cosine similarity. This necessitates defining how the embedded texts are handled. I intend to use a straightforward dot product and normalization approach. Subsequent files will address embedding search, client initialization, data structures, summarization, safety checks, and multilingual query translation.\n\n\n**Defining File Functions**\n\nI've outlined the full structure for the ten Python files, and I am currently focused on defining the individual functions within `embed_text.py`. I've determined that this initial file and `embed_batch.py` will use Google's `generativeai` library. I'll be handling cosine similarity in `similarity_score.py` using NumPy, implementing a dot product with normalization. Other files, such as `embed_for_search.py`, `embeddings_client.py`, and `embeddings_models.py`, will come next. I also plan to use Google Cloud Translation API for `multilingual_query_translate.py` and Google Cloud Text-to-Speech for `retrieval_audio_brief.py`.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
