      "data": {
        "text": "**Constructing Embeddings Module**\n\nI'm now focused on building `embed_batch.py`. It's going to leverage `google.generativeai` to handle the text embedding and use the `embedding-001` model for the embeddings themselves. My goal is to streamline the embedding process.\n\n\n",
