      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Similarity Computation**\n\nI'm focusing on defining the `similarity_score.py` file to calculate cosine similarity. I'm leveraging `numpy` for vector operations, assuming its availability, though I'm mindful of the constraint and will be prepared to implement manual similarity calculation if needed, given the prompt's context.\n\n\n**Constructing Similarity Score**\n\nI'm now creating `similarity_score.py`, focusing on cosine similarity between embedding vectors using NumPy. I'm prioritizing manual calculation as an alternative due to the prompt constraints, remembering to calculate the dot product and L2 norms. I will ensure a fallback implementation, as I recall the cosine similarity formula: (A . B) / (||A|| * ||B||).\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789842997250,
          "start": 1789842995951
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0baf4baef001f01EZy0nH8nFW6",
      "message_id": "msg_0baf4b57c001NHg6q28y2JwTEU",
