      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Search Embedding**\n\nI'm currently focused on `embed_for_search.py`, crafting the functionality to embed queries and documents specifically for semantic search. It's essentially a tailored version of `embed_batch.py`, optimized for the search use case. I'm leaning towards the `embedding-001` model for this.\n\n\n",
